{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Human Accountability in AI DevOps.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Human Accountability in AI DevOps.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"human accountability in ai dev ops human accountability in ai dev ops","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Human Accountability in AI DevOps.md","fileName":"Human Accountability in AI DevOps.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Human Accountability in AI DevOps","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI-Assisted DevOps Practice]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Human Accountability in AI DevOps.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Human Accountability in AI DevOps.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"human accountability in ai dev ops human accountability in ai dev ops","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Human Accountability in AI DevOps.md","fileName":"Human Accountability in AI DevOps.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Human Accountability in AI DevOps","heading":"Human Accountability in AI DevOps","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Human accountability in AI DevOps means production responsibility never transfers to a model. AI may propose a command, configuration, risk assessment, or remediation, but an accountable engineer remains responsible for validating and approving consequential work.\n\nThe operating model is: let AI assist, let humans decide, let deterministic automation execute, and validate the result. Autonomous self-approval increases blast radius because a plausible error can move through environments before anyone notices. Explicit approval gates, audit trails, and named ownership preserve the ability to explain who authorized an action and why.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,